huyong wrote:
> 
> Hello,
> 
> I am a novice at Tru64. I installed oxygen vx1 pci graphic card.. This card
> is supported by Tru64 5.1A(noncommerical version).. I want to use CDE as
> True-color using this card.. I read the mannual for setting this card from
> compaq.. But It seems not to work for me.. Just, It works for setting
> monitor resolution... How can I set CDE as true color? I will appreciate any
> idea which helps me..
> Thanks in advance..
> Bye.

try editing /etc/dt/config/Xservers.  Change

   :0  Local local@console /usr/bin/X11/X :0

to 
   :0   Local local@console /usr/bin/X11/X :0 -vclass TrueColor -depth
24

If if you don't find Xservers in /etc/dt/config, copy it from
/usr/dt/config.


