Terry Shannon from other (unrelated) forums and, while I am much 
surprised that he shares my support of this merger, his support has only 
strengthened my resolve that it is the right way to go.  As I said 
previously, I have no personal stake in this one way or the other.  As 
an independent observer who has used both companies' products 
extensively, I think it is a great move.  Currently HP is not a player 
in the big-iron department (CONVEX anyone??).  The combined company will 
be ubiquitous and I consider that a good thing because both companies 
have a lot to offer.

